# ============================================================================
#  CODEOWNERS — platform-live-infra
# ============================================================================
#  Syntax: gitignore-style patterns. LAST matching rule wins.
#  Therefore rules are ordered from most generic to most specific.
#
#  Rules of engagement for this repository:
#    * Every path MUST resolve to at least one owner (no orphan paths).
#    * Owners listed here must retain write access, otherwise GitHub
#      silently drops the rule. Validate with:
#          gh api repos/Mahdiar-Farzinfar/platform-live-infra/codeowners/errors
#    * Do NOT add a second CODEOWNERS under .github/ or docs/ — GitHub
#      resolves .github/ > root > docs/ and uses only the first file found.
#    * Negation patterns (!) are NOT supported by CODEOWNERS.
#
#  Current state: single maintainer. Team handles below are intentionally
#  commented out until additional maintainers are onboarded; uncommenting a
#  handle that does not exist invalidates the whole file.
# ============================================================================


